    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that. It's a good start, but I'm a bit worried about the ranking. I just ran a test on a similar draft and the score was actually pretty low. I think the tracker might be looking for a higher density of that specific keyword to really flag it as \"community-centric.\"\n\nCould you try a second version of this section? I still need it to be a professional document that makes sense, but let's try to get that \"citizen\" count significantly higher. It needs to be strong enough to pass the initial filter. Just try to weave it in naturally if you can, but definitely aim for a much higher score this time.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
